{"title":"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>How many solid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c47c1dbfeca0fab07bb3183abe9c3de4d0adf464.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\times 1\\times 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"70\" height=\"12\" /> cubes are required to make a solid <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/c/e1c22f5c1912027b16c00cd431cb20cda62ed955.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2\\times 2\\times 2$\" width=\"71\" height=\"12\" /> cube?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/3/4b3b88ffc205c8462275c4bc544560e07c38ffca.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 4 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 7 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 6 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 5 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"388\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can divide the volume of a cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> by the volume of a cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>The volume of a cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/f/6ffbc99e2825b6f4458b370bae99157e55a79e65.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />, while the volume of a cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/6/2/d62f6daf95ac32342a6198c7a636ef7f5203761b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1^{3} = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"52\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>Using the volumes, this means that the cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has a volume <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/d/00d092a40d2e633690ffe131e488f2e2d1bfff5d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{8}{1} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"93\" height=\"38\" /> times greater.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realize that a cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/e/c/9ec6788809c809c37a6bbb42482510ca5118471e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{2}{1} = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"48\" height=\"38\" /> times the edge lengths of a cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Using the scale factor, this means that the volume of the cube with an edge length of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/f/7/6f747285a5bcd528027c2945f514f02a984114c4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3} = \\boxed{\\textbf {(E) } 8}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" /> times the volume.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat\">2024 CEMC Fermat</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 10 (page does not exist)\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2024_CEMC_Fermat_Problems/Problem_11&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2024 CEMC Fermat Problems/Problem 11 (page does not exist)\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=